    "title": "UFC 200",
    "pageid": 48625599,
    "revid": 1372784789,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><i><b>UFC 200: Tate vs. Nunes</b></i> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Mixed_martial_arts\" title=\"Mixed martial arts\">mixed martial arts</a> event produced by the <a href=\"/wiki/Ultimate_Fighting_Championship\" title=\"Ultimate Fighting Championship\">Ultimate Fighting Championship</a> held on July 9, 2016, at the <a href=\"/wiki/T-Mobile_Arena\" title=\"T-Mobile Arena\">T-Mobile Arena</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Las_Vegas_Strip\" title=\"Las Vegas Strip\">Las Vegas Strip</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Paradise,_Nevada\" title=\"Paradise, Nevada\">Paradise, Nevada</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UFC200_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UFC200-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>It was the final UFC event under the ownership of <a href=\"/wiki/Frank_Fertitta_III\" title=\"Frank Fertitta III\">Frank</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lorenzo_Fertitta\" title=\"Lorenzo Fertitta\">Lorenzo Fertitta</a>, which began in January 2001. <a href=\"/wiki/Zuffa\" title=\"Zuffa\">Zuffa</a> subsequently announced its sale to a group led by <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/WME-IMG\" title=\"WME-IMG\">WME-IMG</a>, an American <a href=\"/wiki/Talent_agency\" title=\"Talent agency\">talent agency</a> with offices in <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Beverly_Hills\" title=\"Beverly Hills\">Beverly Hills</a>, which included <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Silver_Lake_Partners\" title=\"Silver Lake Partners\">Silver Lake Partners</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Kohlberg_Kravis_Roberts\" title=\"Kohlberg Kravis Roberts\">Kohlberg Kravis Roberts</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Michael_Dell\" title=\"Michael Dell\">MSD Partners</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p></div>"
  }
}
